        <p class="hint">支持 ${_d(a0_0x128e82(0x2b57,'\x21\x58\x52\x21')+a0_0x128e82(0xad3,'\x44\x66\x6c\x55'))}://（可带 user:pass@）、http(s)://、${_d(a0_0x128e82(0xaa6,'\x5e\x58\x25\x23')+a0_0x128e82(0xcf6,'\x7a\x4b\x75\x39'))} 或 host:port（默认按 ${_d(a0_0x128e82(0x26c5,'\x58\x74\x73\x65')+a0_0x128e82(0x3a42,'\x43\x6e\x54\x45'))}，端口 1080）。此项控制 Worker 的真实转发出口，不会作为节点字段写进订阅；验证出口 IP 时请选择“仅走出口（only）”，默认模式在代理失败时会回退直连。SS 加密支持 ${_d(a0_0x128e82(0x29d6,'\x4a\x58\x46\x5e')+a0_0x128e82(0x36a5,'\x4c\x23\x67\x32')+a0_0x128e82(0x24cd,'\x44\x66\x6c\x55')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x128e82(0x2ce0,'\x4c\x70\x43\x62')+a0_0x128e82(0x125d,'\x74\x5d\x4a\x4e')+a0_0x128e82(0x2ad6,'\x42\x42\x6d\x6a')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x128e82(0xe8b,'\x21\x54\x79\x58')+a0_0x128e82(0x40e7,'\x5b\x45\x41\x49')+'\x41\x3d')}-ietf-poly1305。</p>
